# Week 1 – QuickBite Delivery Website

## Learning Activities & Resources

This week I developed **QuickBite Delivery**, a simple website concept for an online food delivery service. The aim of the project was to design a website that allows customers to browse restaurant menus, place food orders online, and learn about the services offered by the platform.

While creating the website, I focused on organising content into clear sections and designing pages that are easy for users to navigate. I also practised structuring information using headings, lists, and responsive layouts to improve readability and user experience.

